{{/*
Connection used by performance reporting to read a run's own task timings back from
the REST API. Task pods have no metadata-database access and their execution-API token
does not cover task instances, so this is the only route to per-task durations.
Credentials come from the account the chart already provisions, so no new secret
material is introduced here.
*/}}
apiVersion: v1
